[{"client_msg_id":"bd647252-5b8b-4ac5-a86f-bf8f41d96216","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"そういえば `nvim-lspconfig` は既に hrsh7th さんの `vscode-langservers-extracted` の html, css, json (今は更に eslint もってこと) の LS に変更済みでした","ts":"1635123040.095100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+2V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eba3c356-546a-44d4-b69f-61276bb5fb15","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"汎用性に振ってるからなあ...eslint_d使う設定も入れるか?(eslintあると両方動いてしまうけど)","ts":"1635114531.094700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AJW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B7EDFF5E-557D-424E-8075-ED8955FDA53B","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"eslint 以外でも先行で入ってる html, css. json のLSは新しいのが使えるってメリットはあるかもとも思います","ts":"1635089966.093900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+pfzY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"360b866b-cd12-463f-8c30-337b5ec5d31c","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"vscode-langservers-extracted 対応させようかと思ったけど、eslint をローカルで動かしてるから、やるモチベーションが湧かないので誰か :pray:","ts":"1635089745.091200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yit"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eaded366-5ba0-4a1c-a346-404de8f92213","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"お、なるほど","ts":"1635089627.090200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DkW3G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95dbdc91-d8a5-456b-bb0e-e8fad92139d6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"diagnostics-langserver とかじゃなく、eslint 目的ならそっちを使うほうが楽かもしれません。","ts":"1635089514.090000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wRZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cf2c193-86bf-438a-a442-26f2abb3a7d0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そういえば、最近 vscode-langservers-extr